          <span class="ppg-related-btn">Use This Free Tool</span>
          <span class="ppg-no-acct">No account needed</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/medicare-donut-hole-calculator/" class="ppg-related-card">
        <span class="ppg-related-icon">🍩</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Medicare Drug Coverage Gap Calculator</strong>
          <p>Estimate when you will reach the Part D coverage phases and your new $2,000 annual cap.</p>
          <span class="ppg-related-btn">Use This Free Tool</span>
          <span class="ppg-no-acct">No account needed</span>
        </div>
